00:20:36,880 --> 00:20:40,880
 You need to consider the non-negotiable rules.

179
00:20:40,880 --> 00:20:51,880
 EU AI Act, that's pretty much non-negotiable if you're planning on making a service available in the European Union and it has AI, and it has any form of AI, not just generative AI.

180
00:20:51,880 --> 00:20:53,880
 GDPR, we will love data privacy.

181
00:20:53,880 --> 00:20:58,880
 And compliance standards have already exist.

182
00:20:58,880 --> 00:21:06,880
 Most organisations will be looking at some form of ISO 27001 because they want to be trusted by other organisations.

183
00:21:06,880 --> 00:21:08,880
 In those order processes, etc.

184
00:21:08,880 --> 00:21:11,880
 There will be security and risk management frameworks.

185
00:21:11,880 --> 00:21:12,880
 A few of those are available now.

